      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out. my dad, his brother, even my grandfather... it's all the same pattern. it's like it's written in my blood that i'm just gonna break eventually. no matter how much i try to stay \"okay,\" it feels like i'm just fighting a losing battle against my own DNA. like i'm a ticking time bomb.",
