      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right to feel the weight of that pattern, but the math is wrong because your brain is not a machine; it is a living thing that can rewrite the code. The fact that you are even questioning this certainty proves you are not just a broken vessel waiting to fall, but a person fighting to understand why it hurts so much. Please do not let the story of your ancestors define your entire future, because you have the power to choose a different path than the one they walked.",
